MODIFICATIONS TO THE SHIPPED WINE COMPONENTS

None. The Wine PE builtin DLLs shipped with this product are unmodified
upstream builds -- see the `PROVENANCE` file (no extension) alongside this
one for the exact version, git commit, build configuration and per-file
SHA-256 hashes they were built from (compliance checklist B0, B4.1).

That `PROVENANCE` file is supplied by the Wine build itself (the --wine-dist
directory passed to .github/scripts/build_app.sh, which requires it) and so
exists only inside an actual bundled release, alongside this file -- it is
not tracked in this source repository, and is not the same file as
`PROVENANCE.md` in this same directory, which instead documents where
*this directory's own COPYING.LIB text* came from and is unrelated to any
particular Wine build.

If a patch is ever unavoidable (B4.2: fixed on exemu's native side first;
patching Wine is the last resort), this file must instead list, per patched
file, what changed and on what date (B4.4), and the patch itself must be
published under LGPL-2.1-or-later as part of the source made available under
B3. Do not edit this file to describe a hypothetical or planned patch --
only a patch that has actually shipped.
